implementationPlan.description:
Verification. Run it once, fresh, after the last edit; its output is the complete_task evidence. From the task worktree, run the checkRef exactly as given in the executionContract:
- a Linux snapshot under env -i with node v24.21.0;
- then a Windows snapshot through cmd.exe;
- each leg runs npm ci, npm test and npm run compile in moe-vscode;
- then parity-check and lint in the worktree.
Both legs must be green. W6 runs only on Linux and W7 only on Windows, so one leg is not enough. Report the test counts of both legs. Never run npm ci or npm test inside the checkout (global rail).
Error handling: if a row unrelated to this diff flakes, rerun the whole command fresh and report both outputs. Do not widen this task to edit unrelated tests (`mem:gotcha-vscode-provenance-test-deadlines`).
